      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The diagnostic value of ST-changes in the ECG in temporary myocardial ischemia is described: the importance of detecting \"silent\" ischemia is stressed. Methods for long-time-ECG-recordings are frequency- as well as amplitude-modulations."},
